   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Voucher Ticket\n\nA discount ticket with notched, perforated edges slides in, the headline (\"DISKON 20%\") lands, and the stub tears off while its code reveals with a short scramble. Horizontal in landscape, stacked in portrait. Headline, code, note and shop are variables.\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 5.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Handing out a discount code or coupon in a promo video.\n- A small shop's voucher for followers or first-time customers.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A sale price shown on one product: use price-drop.\n- A stamp or points card: use loyalty-stamp-card.\n- A countdown to the end of the offer: use event-countdown-clock.\n\nVariables:\n- shop (string): Shop name, default \"Kopi Senja\"\n- headline (string): Headline, default \"DISKON 20%\"\n- note (string): Note, default \"Min. belanja Rp50.000 \\u00b7 s/d 30 Nov\"\n- code_label (string): Code label, default \"Kode voucher\"\n- code (string): Code, default \"SENJA20\"\n- tear_at (number, 1-3.5): Tear time, default 1.9\n- ticket_color (color): Ticket colour, default \"#f4f4f5\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- main_color (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
